    "content": "For her historic headlining set at Coachella 2026 (Weekend 1), Karol G brought out Becky G, Wisin, Mariah Angeliq, and Cigarettes After Sex. She featured special guests to celebrate Latin music, including a performance of \"MAMIII\" with Becky G and reggaeton classics with Wisin.Watch this video to see the moment Becky G joined Karol G on stage:37sEntertainment TonightYouTube• Apr 13, 2026Key guest appearances and performances included:Becky G: Joined for their hit song \"MAMIII,\" accompanied by an all-female mariachi band.Wisin: Performed reggaeton classics like \"Pam Pam,\" \"Mayor Que Yo,\" and \"Rakata\".Mariah Angeliq: Performed their collaboration \"EL MAKINON\".Cigarettes After Sex: Joined for a new song collaboration.Karol G's set, which took place on Sunday, April 12, 2026, made her the first-ever Latina to headline the Coachella festival.",
